WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:15.825
Oh, Who are you?

2
00:00:17.506 --> 00:00:18.726
I am a chimpanzee.

3
00:00:20.227 --> 00:00:21.748
Chimpanzees are apes.

4
00:00:23.549 --> 00:00:24.630
Where do you live?

5
00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:28.192
We live in tropical forests in Africa.

6
00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:32.233
We usually stay in trees.

7
00:00:33.954 --> 00:00:34.895
What do you eat?

8
00:00:36.095 --> 00:00:37.316
We eat lots of things.

9
00:00:38.697 --> 00:00:41.558
We like fruit, nuts, leaves, and insects.

10
00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:45.060
Sometimes we eat meat.

11
00:00:46.721 --> 00:00:49.082
Your hands look like human hands.

12
00:00:50.423 --> 00:00:52.044
I can use tools like humans.

13
00:00:53.204 --> 00:00:55.085
We use sticks to find bugs.

14
00:00:57.687 --> 00:00:59.568
We use rocks to crack nuts.

15
00:01:00.984 --> 00:01:02.105
Do you live alone?

16
00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:04.606
No, we live in groups.

17
00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:08.807
Chimpanzees love to be with other chimps.

18
00:01:10.288 --> 00:01:12.789
My group has almost one hundred chimps.

19
00:01:14.509 --> 00:01:17.070
Wow! That must be loud!

20
00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:21.132
Yep! Like humans, we often talk to each other.

21
00:01:22.233 --> 00:01:23.993
We make sounds to communicate.

22
00:01:25.074 --> 00:01:27.255
We also use our faces and hands.

23
00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:29.936
That's cool!

24
00:01:31.896 --> 00:01:33.357
Do you have any enemies?

25
00:01:34.558 --> 00:01:36.759
Sometimes leopards and lions hunt us.

26
00:01:37.919 --> 00:01:40.481
And sometimes we fight other chimpanzee groups.

27
00:01:46.044 --> 00:01:48.045
Oh! Another chimp found a fruit tree.

28
00:01:49.245 --> 00:01:50.426
Time for lunch.

29
00:01:52.207 --> 00:01:53.708
Good-bye, Chimpanzee.
